message: "If you use this software, please cite it (metadata below) and the Syntropa preprint (https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.22129408)."
title: "Syntropa: a physics-gated substrate for composing and validating heterogeneous cell and ecosystem models"
abstract: "A Python substrate for composing heterogeneous biological models (first-principles reactions, empirical lookups, kinetic SBML, genome-scale FBA) into micro-ecosystems checked by a layered physics-based validity stack."
